@host = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@accessToken = paste-your-access-token-here

### AI 对话（同步）
POST {{host}}/ai/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "你好，介绍一下你自己"
}

### AI 对话（SSE 流式）
# 注意：响应为 text/event-stream，REST Client 会以流形式展示
POST {{host}}/ai/chat/stream
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "message": "给我讲一个简短的故事"
}

### AI 对话（SSE 流式，指定模型配置 ID）
POST {{host}}/ai/chat/stream
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "message": "用一句话介绍你自己",
  "modelId": "seed-ai-model-default"
}

### AI 用量汇总（需要 ai:usage:list 权限）
GET {{host}}/ai/usage
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 供应商配置列表（需要 ai:config:list 权限，apiKey 掩码返回）
GET {{host}}/ai/providers
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 新增供应商（需要 ai:config:create 权限，可携带模型列表）
POST {{host}}/ai/providers
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "DeepSeek",
  "protocol": "OPENAI_COMPAT",
  "baseUrl": "https://api.deepseek.com/v1",
  "apiKey": "sk-xxxx",
  "remark": "http 用例",
  "models": [
    {
      "name": "deepseek-chat",
      "label": "DeepSeek V3",
      "maxOutput": 8192,
      "contextWindow": 65536,
      "isDefault": false
    }
  ]
}

### 修改供应商（需要 ai:config:update 权限；apiKey 缺省保留原值，models 整体替换）
PUT {{host}}/ai/providers/some-provider-id
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "DeepSeek",
  "protocol": "OPENAI_COMPAT",
  "baseUrl": "https://api.deepseek.com/v1",
  "remark": "改用 deepseek-reasoner",
  "models": [
    {
      "name": "deepseek-reasoner",
      "label": "R1",
      "maxOutput": 8192,
      "contextWindow": 65536,
      "enabled": true,
      "isDefault": true
    }
  ]
}

### 删除供应商（软删除，需要 ai:config:delete 权限）
DELETE {{host}}/ai/providers/some-provider-id
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 从端点自动发现模型列表（OpenAI 兼容 /models；限流 10 次/分钟）
POST {{host}}/ai/providers/fetch-models
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "baseUrl": "https://api.deepseek.com/v1",
  "apiKey": "sk-xxxx",
  "protocol": "OPENAI_COMPAT"
}

### 对话页可用模型列表（需要 ai:chat:ask 权限，含全局默认模型）
GET {{host}}/ai/models
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
